# Izek Strazni's camp talks (Story Allies Presence Plan, package Z2; story/camp_talk.gd, docs/story/camp.md "Guests ask too",
# docs/story/izek_brother.md). When Izek and Ireena both travel with the party, a Long Rest at camp can bring the three scenes between
# the two of them, one a night, in order: the first doll, their parents, the name he shouted through the trees
# (narrative/allies/izek.dialogue: sister_1, sister_2, sister_3, the same scenes the hub offers at her door). Each plays once; the
# later scene's condition waits for the one before it. Izek asks (his name is written first, as the camp reads it).

~ talk_sister_3
if guest:izek and guest:ireena and flag.izek_sister_2 and not flag.izek_sister_3
-> allies/izek:sister_3
endif
-> END

~ talk_sister_2
if guest:izek and guest:ireena and flag.izek_sister_1 and not flag.izek_sister_2
-> allies/izek:sister_2
endif
-> END

~ talk_sister_1
if guest:izek and guest:ireena and not flag.izek_sister_1
-> allies/izek:sister_1
endif
-> END
